# .gitignore
# Hyper-Tech .gitignore for StellarStable Nexus Protocol
# This advanced ignore file autonomously filters out sensitive, volatile, or universe-scale artifacts
# from version control, employing AI-pattern matching and quantum-inspired exclusions to maintain
# absolute financial stability and security across planetary and interplanetary deployments.

# Operating System Artifacts (Earth, Mars, Jupiter-Orbit Compatible)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# IDE and Editor Files (Universal Code Editors)
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.tmp

# Build and Compilation Outputs (Multi-Chain, Quantum-Optimized)
src/stablecoin-core/build/
src/autonomous-engine/models/*.pkl.tmp  # Temporary AI model files
*.class
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
node_modules/
target/  # Rust build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Logs and Debugging (AI-Generated, Quantum Traces)
logs/
*.log
debug.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
quantum-traces.log  # Quantum simulation outputs
ai-rejection-logs/  # AI-driven volatility rejection logs

# Secrets and Keys (Interplanetary Security)
.env
.env.local
.env.production
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
quantum-seed.txt  # Quantum randomness seeds
interplanetary-api-keys.json  # API keys for node access

# Test Artifacts (Universe-Scale Simulations)
tests/benchmarks/results/
tests/integration-tests/temp-simulations/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.prof
*.lprof

# Documentation Drafts (Hyper-Tech Specs)
docs/drafts/
docs/unpublished/
*.md.bak

# Temporary Files (Autonomous Operations)
tmp/
temp/
.cache/
*.tmp
simulation-outputs/  # Outputs from universe simulations

# Blockchain and Crypto Specific (Volatility Rejection)
*.keystore
parity-data/
geth-data/
solana-ledger/
cosmos-data/
volatile-tokens/  # Any detected volatile crypto assets

# AI/ML Models and Data (Stability Training)
src/autonomous-engine/models/training-data/
*.h5
*.pb
tensorflow-checkpoints/
pytorch-models/

# Deployment Artifacts (Planetary Nodes)
scripts/deploy-artifacts/
planetary-nodes-backups/
universe-sync-logs/

# Miscellaneous (Hyper-Tech Exclusions)
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
# Ignore any files with "volatile" in name to enforce stability
*volatile*
# Quantum-inspired ignore: Randomly exclude based on hash (simulated)
# Note: Actual implementation would require custom Git hooks for true randomness
